# Cross-platform line endings.
#
# Shell and Python/Blender bridge scripts MUST stay LF so they run on
# macOS/Linux and inside the Linux Docker image, even when committed from a
# Windows checkout (where core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite them to
# CRLF and produce "bad interpreter" / parse errors).
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.command   text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts stay CRLF.
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.ps1       text eol=crlf
